  (267, 'One Day Class with Bang Muzammil Hasballah', 'one-day-class-with-bang-muzammil-hasballah', '<p style=\"text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-word;\" class=\"ql-align-justify\">Alhamdulillah One Day Class bersama Bang Muzammil Hasballah berjalan lancar, banyak sekali nasihat yang didapatkan. Semoga semakin banyak anak muda yang mencintai Al Quran.</p><p style=\"text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-word;\" class=\"ql-align-justify\">Kegiatan ini dihadari oleh beragam pencari ilmu yang bersemangat untuk mendapatkan Ilmu dari kalangan usia muda hingga tua.</p><p style=\"text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-word;\" class=\"ql-align-justify\">Kegiatan ini juga sebagai wadah solidaritas Cinta Palestina.</p><p style=\"text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-word;\" class=\"ql-align-justify\">\"Semakin sering seseorang berinteraksi dengan Quran semakin takut ia kepada Rabb nya\"</p><p style=\"text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-word;\" class=\"ql-align-justify\"><img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-3619\" src=\"/uploads/2024/12/whatsapp-image-2024-12-17-at-102423-6-300x225.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"225\" /></p><p style=\"text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-word;\" class=\"ql-align-justify\"><img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-3620\" src=\"/uploads/2024/12/whatsapp-image-2024-12-17-at-102423-5-300x225.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"225\" /></p><p style=\"text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-word;\" class=\"ql-align-justify\"><img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-3621\" src=\"/uploads/2024/12/whatsapp-image-2024-12-17-at-102423-4-300x225.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"225\" /></p><p style=\"text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-word;\" class=\"ql-align-justify\"><img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-3622\" src=\"/uploads/2024/12/whatsapp-image-2024-12-17-at-102423-3-225x300.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"225\" height=\"300\" /></p><p style=\"text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-word;\" c