  (324, 'Day 2 [MUNAQOSAH TAHFIDHZ TAHSIN QUR\'AN KELAS AKHIR]', 'day-2-munaqosah-tahfidhz-tahsin-quran-kelas-akhir', '<p style=\"text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-word;\" class=\"ql-align-justify\">[MUNAQOSAH TAHFIDHZUL QUR\'AN KELAS AKHIR TAHUN AJARAN 2022/2023]</p><p style=\"text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-word;\" class=\"ql-align-justify\">Baarokallahu fiikum kepada ananda yang telah mengikuti Munaqosah Tahfidhzul Qur\'an Kelas Akhir SMA IT Ishlahul Ummah Prabumulih.</p><p style=\"text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-word;\" class=\"ql-align-justify\">Kamis, 23 Februari 2023</p><p style=\"text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-word;\" class=\"ql-align-justify\">👳‍♀ Ikhwan</p><p style=\"text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-word;\" class=\"ql-align-justify\">💐 Ananda Faqih Al-Ridho (Juz 30-29(Al-mulk-Nuh))<br />nKelas XII.IPA Gaza</p><p style=\"text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-word;\" class=\"ql-align-justify\">💐 Ananda Abi Anggara (30-29(Al-mulk-Al-Haqqah))<br />nKelas XII.IPA Gaza</p><p style=\"text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-word;\" class=\"ql-align-justify\">💐 Ananda Febrian Saputra (Juz 30 &amp; 1(ayat 1- )<br />nKelas XII.IPS Gaza</p><p style=\"text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-word;\" class=\"ql-align-justify\">💐 Ananda M Aqil Ilham (Juz 30 (An-nas-Al-balad))<br />nKelas XII. IPS Gaza</p><p style=\"text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-word;\" class=\"ql-align-justify\">💐 Ananda Ahid Al-ghifari (Juz 30,29 &amp; 1)<br />nKelas XII.IPS Gaza</p><p style=\"text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-word;\" class=\"ql-align-justify\">🧕🏻 Akhwat</p><p style=\"text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-word;\" class=\"ql-align-justify\">💐 Ananda Seren Rahmadani (Juz 30 &amp; 29 (Al-Mulk- Al-Ma\'arij )<br />nKelas XII.IPA Gaza</p><p style=\"text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-word;\" class=\"ql-align-justify\">💐 Ananda Ishmah Nur Amalina (Juz 30,29 &amp; 1 (Al Baqarah: 1- 76 ))<br />nKelas XII.IPA Gaza</p><p styl